{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Niban Dashi (Second Sea Stock)",
  "text": "Niban Dashi (Second Sea Stock)\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield: Makes about 4 cups\n\nIngredients\n\n4 cups water,\n\nKombu and katsuobushi used in ichiban dashi\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Combine all of the ingredients in a pan.\n\n2. Place the pan over low heat and cook the mixture for 10 minutes.\n\n3. Remove the pan from the heat and then strain the stock through a wire sieve lined with muslin or filter paper.\n\n2. Refrigerate the stock in a tightly covered container for up to 4 days in the refrigerator.",
  "recipeYield": "Makes about 4 cups",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "4 cups water,",
    "Kombu and katsuobushi used in ichiban dashi"
  ],
