      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Place the pan over low heat and cook the mixture for 10 minutes."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Remove the pan from the heat and then strain the stock through a wire sieve lined with muslin or filter paper."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Refrigerate the stock in a tightly covered container for up to 4 days in the refrigerator."
    }
